From 322e5912c23b7345771151c0bdac88a7e108966e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Vis <118430440+mark-vis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:26:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/28] (b) v2, optional O1: nameref title of captions

\@caption stores the list text in \@currentlabelname (not for
\caption*), so that a \label after a caption records it as the title
for named references, as for headings. Before, with \DocumentMetadata
and hyperref, the title of the last heading was recorded. This changes
the third field of \newlabel for labelled captions.
